<title>USA: Mackie Designs COO resigns.</title>
<headline>Mackie Designs COO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>WOODINVILLE, Wash. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mackie Designs said on Tuesday that Stephen Ripp has resigned as chief operating officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said it is looking for a replacement for Ripp.</p>
